
* Standard vendor SPICE models (ON Semi / Fairchild 2N3904 & 2N2222A; NXP BC547B)
.model Q2N3904 NPN(IS=6.734f BF=416.4 NE=1.259 ISE=6.734f IKF=66.78m BR=.7371 NC=2 RC=1 RB=10 VAF=74.03 CJC=3.638p MJC=.3085 VJC=.75 FC=.5 CJE=4.493p MJE=.2593 VJE=.75 TR=239.5n TF=301.2p)
.model Q2N2222A NPN(IS=14.34f BF=255.9 NE=1.307 ISE=14.34f IKF=.2847 BR=6.092 NC=2 RC=1 RB=10 VAF=74.03 CJC=7.306p MJC=.3416 VJC=.75 FC=.5 CJE=22.01p MJE=.377 VJE=.75 TR=46.91n TF=411.1p)
.model BC547B NPN(IS=2.39E-14 NF=1.008 ISE=3.545E-15 NE=1.541 BF=294.3 IKF=0.1357 VAF=63.2 NR=1.004 ISC=6.272E-14 NC=1.243 BR=7.946 IKR=0.1144 VAR=25.9 RB=1 RE=0.4683 RC=0.85 CJE=1.358E-11 VJE=0.65 MJE=0.3279 TF=4.391E-10 CJC=3.728E-12 VJC=0.3997 MJC=0.2955 TR=1E-9 FC=0.9579)
.model D1N34A D(IS=1.3e-7 N=1.3 RS=7 CJO=0.6p VJ=0.3 M=0.4 TT=2n)
.model D1N4148 D(IS=2.52n N=1.752 RS=0.568 CJO=4p M=0.4 VJ=0.75 TT=20n)
.model LEDG D(IS=4.7e-20 N=2 RS=5 CJO=20p)

* μNode32U4 — AVCC isolation vs frequency — generated from the routed board by harness/tools/board_to_spice.mjs
* J1: the USB port — VBUS source + port/cable resistance
VJ1_VBUS vbus_src 0 5 AC 1
RJ1_PORT vbus_src n_f1_pin1 0.5
* F1: 500 mA-hold PTC polyfuse, cold ≈ 0.3 Ω (thermal mass: µs inrush
* pulses are over long before it could trip — that's the point)
RF1 n_f1_pin1 v5 0.3
R1 n_j1_dplus n_r1_pin2 22
R2 n_j1_dminus n_r2_pin2 22
* U1: ATmega32U4 — only the pieces the datasheet draws as blocks:
RU1_CORE v5 0 250  ; digital core ≈ 20 mA @ 5 V, 16 MHz
RU1_AVCC1 avcc1 0 3k  ; analog section ≈ 1.7 mA per rail
RU1_AVCC2 avcc2 0 3k
* internal 3.3 V regulator for USB (UCAP pin, datasheet §2.2.6):
EU1_3V3 u1_3v3 0 v5 0 0.66
RU1_3V3 u1_3v3 n_c7_pin1 2
* the oscillator pins' network (§6.3): the chip biases XTAL1/XTAL2 at
* mid-rail through its internal feedback and output structures, with
* ESD clamps bounding them to the rails. The ACTIVE part — the
* transconductance that cancels the crystal's 142 Ω of loss every
* cycle and sustains oscillation — lives inside the chip; designers
* verify it with the negative-resistance method (see crystal-ring):
* any stage that presents more than −Rm at the pins keeps the ring
* alive forever.
RMID_A v5 u1_mid 100k
RMID_B u1_mid 0 100k
RU1RF xtal1 xtal2 10meg
RU1RO xtal2 u1_mid 20k
DU1CLH xtal2 v5 D1N4148
DU1CLL 0 xtal2 D1N4148
* the pins' ESD/protection structures give otherwise-floating analog
* nodes (D+, D−, AREF) a weak DC reference, like the real chip does:
RU1_BLE_DP n_r1_pin2 0 10meg
RU1_BLE_DM n_r2_pin2 0 10meg
RU1_BLE_AREF aref 0 10meg
RC1_ESR v5 c1_c 0.15
LC1_ESL c1_c c1_l 1.5e-9
CC1 c1_l 0 0.0000047
RC2_ESR v5 c2_c 0.2
LC2_ESL c2_c c2_l 1.2e-9
CC2 c2_l 0 0.000001
RC3_ESR v5 c3_c 0.05
LC3_ESL c3_c c3_l 8e-10
CC3 c3_l 0 1e-7
RC4_ESR avcc1 c4_c 0.05
LC4_ESL c4_c c4_l 8e-10
CC4 c4_l 0 1e-7
* FB2: 0603 ferrite bead (BLM18PG221-class): 0.05 Ω DCR, ~1 µH ∥ 330 Ω
RFB2_DCR v5 fb2_x 0.05
LFB2 fb2_x avcc1 1u
RFB2_LOSS fb2_x avcc1 330
RC5_ESR v5 c5_c 0.05
LC5_ESL c5_c c5_l 8e-10
CC5 c5_l 0 1e-7
RC6_ESR avcc2 c6_c 0.05
LC6_ESL c6_c c6_l 8e-10
CC6 c6_l 0 1e-7
RC7_ESR n_c7_pin1 c7_c 0.15
LC7_ESL c7_c c7_l 1.5e-9
CC7 c7_l 0 0.000001
RC8_ESR v5 c8_c 0.05
LC8_ESL c8_c c8_l 8e-10
CC8 c8_l 0 1e-7
RC9_ESR aref c9_c 0.05
LC9_ESL c9_c c9_l 8e-10
CC9 c9_l 0 1e-7
* FB1: 0603 ferrite bead (BLM18PG221-class): 0.05 Ω DCR, ~1 µH ∥ 330 Ω
RFB1_DCR v5 fb1_x 0.05
LFB1 fb1_x avcc2 1u
RFB1_LOSS fb1_x avcc2 330
* Y1: 16 MHz crystal — the motional arm (R-L-C in series) that resonates,
* plus the case capacitance across it. f_series ≈ 15.997 MHz; the load
* caps pull it up to 16.000 MHz. Q ≈ 10 k.
RY1M xtal2 y1_m 142
LY1M y1_m y1_k 14.14m
CY1M y1_k xtal1 7f
CY1S xtal2 xtal1 3.5p
RC10_ESR xtal1 c10_c 0.05
LC10_ESL c10_c c10_l 8e-10
CC10 c10_l 0 2.2e-11
RC11_ESR xtal2 c11_c 0.05
LC11_ESL c11_c c11_l 8e-10
CC11 c11_l 0 2.2e-11
R3 v5 rst 10000
* SW1: RESET button — not pressed
R4 v5 hwb 10000
* SW2: HWB button — not pressed
* J3: ICSP header — nothing plugged in
DLED1 v5 n_led1_pin2 LEDG
R5 n_led1_pin2 0 1000
DLED2 n_led2_pin1 0 LEDG
R6 d13 n_led2_pin1 1000
DLED3 v5 n_led3_pin2 LEDG
R7 n_led3_pin2 n_r7_pin2 1000
DLED4 v5 n_led4_pin2 LEDG
R8 n_led4_pin2 ss 1000
R9 v5 sda 4700
R10 v5 scl 4700
* J2: GPIO header — nothing plugged in
* J4: analog/GPIO header — nothing plugged in
.ac dec 120 100k 1g
.end
